=== scene jh_hi
jiho[happy]: {안녕}!
(A kid with a school bag as big as he is. No 요 anywhere: he talks to you like you're in his class.)

=== scene jh_what
jiho: {뭐} {해}?
(He tries to read your notebook upside down.)
* {탈}{을|을/를} {찾아요}. -> jh_what_a
* {몰라요}. -> jh_what_b

=== scene jh_what_a
jiho[surprised]: {탈}? {진짜}?
(His eyes go wide.)
jiho[happy]: {좋아}! {같이} {가}!
(He marches off three steps, realizes he has no idea where, and comes back.)
! rel jiho +1

=== scene jh_what_b
jiho[happy]: {몰라}? 하하. {나}{도} {몰라}.
(He shrugs with his whole body.)

=== scene jh_homework
jiho[sad]: {숙제} {싫어}.
(He gives his school bag a small kick.)
* {저}{도} {싫어요}. -> jh_homework_a
* {숙제} {좋아요}! -> jh_homework_b

=== scene jh_homework_a
jiho[happy]: 하하! {좋아}!
(At last, an adult who understands.)
! rel jiho +1

=== scene jh_homework_b
jiho[surprised]: {진짜}...?
(He looks at you the way you would look at someone who likes the dentist.)

=== scene jh_bye
jiho: {안녕}!
(He is gone before you can answer.)

=== scene jh_game
jiho[happy]: {같이} {놀아}! {빨리}!
(He has a pebble in each hand and a look of great seriousness.)
* {네}! -> jh_game_a
* {바빠요}. -> jh_game_b

=== scene jh_game_a
jiho[happy]: {좋아}! {나}{는|은/는} {진짜} {잘해}!
(He throws both pebbles. They land nowhere in particular. He declares himself the winner.)
! rel jiho +1

=== scene jh_game_b
jiho[sad]: {바빠}? {나}{도} {바빠}... {숙제}.
(He drags his feet off toward home.)

=== scene jh_ask_mask
jiho[surprised]: {탈}? {무서워}!
(He pulls an enormous grin with his fingers, then shivers dramatically.)

=== scene ev_bigfish_told
jiho[surprised]: {할아버지}{가|이/가} {큰} {물고기} {잡았어}! {진짜}!
(He spreads his arms as wide as they go. Then a bit wider.)
jiho: {그리고}... {다시} {줬어}! {강}{에}!
(He can't believe it either: caught it, and let it go.)

=== scene jh_bye2
jiho[happy]: {내일}! {내일} {같이}!
(He runs off, then runs back to make sure you heard, then runs off again.)

=== scene jh_bye3
jiho: {배고파요}...
(He wanders off in the direction of the restaurant.)
